# Keep secrets, dev junk, and build cruft out of the image — Pitfall #7
# (never bake .env into a layer) and §Standard Stack (.dockerignore).
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
*.test.ts
*.test.tsx
**/__tests__/**
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.git
.gitignore
.planning
tests
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
*.log
coverage
.nyc_output
